  "instagram_caption": "There is a betting system that sounds like it can never lose.\n\nThe martingale says double your bet after every loss. Every win nets just $1, the bets explode ($1,024 after ten losses), streaks happen, and green pockets keep the house edge. Even on a fair game, the average result is zero.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+\n\nHas anyone ever told you doubling up after a loss can't fail?\n\n#theriggedgame #martingale #casinomyths #probability #houseedge",
  "youtube_title": "The Betting System That Can Never Lose (Except It Does)",
  "youtube_description": "The martingale says to double your bet after every loss, so the first win gets everything back plus $1. Four reasons it fails: tiny wins, exploding bets, losing streaks and limited money, and the house edge from the green pockets. Even on a fair game the results average out to zero.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+ AI narration.\n\nSources:\n• Scientific American, \"The Gambling Strategy That's Guaranteed to Make Money and Why You Should Never Use It\"\n\nThe Rigged Game: how casinos really work. Instagram: @the_rigged_game\n\n#Casino #Probability #Shorts"
